WEBVTT

01:03:58.593 --> 01:04:01.790
To listen to Kai-Fu's
TED Talk, visit TED.com.

01:04:01.814 --> 01:04:04.545
(Music)

01:04:04.569 --> 01:04:07.263
This week's show
was produced by Megan Tan.

01:04:08.015 --> 01:04:10.491
Our production manager
is Roxanne Hai Lash.

01:04:10.515 --> 01:04:12.586
Our mix engineer -- David Herman,

01:04:12.610 --> 01:04:15.792
our theme music
is by Allison Layton-Brown.

01:04:15.816 --> 01:04:18.421
Special thanks
to my colleague Michelle Quint.

01:04:19.862 --> 01:04:23.275
If this discussion about
the future of AI gets you buzzing,

01:04:23.299 --> 01:04:24.513
tell us about it.

01:04:24.537 --> 01:04:29.156
Rate and review the show on iTunes
or wherever you get your podcasts.

01:04:29.756 --> 01:04:32.021
I'm Chris Anderson, thanks for listening.